---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site, base } from '../config/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy"><section class="shell simple"><h1>Privacy</h1><p>Last updated October 27, 2026.</p><h2>What we collect</h2><p>{site.name} is a static site. We do not run visitor accounts, we do not run advertising trackers, and we do not sell or share visitor data — there is no visitor data to sell. Our hosting provider records standard web server logs (IP address, requested page, timestamp) for security and reliability; we do not otherwise combine that with anything that identifies you.</p><h2>Cookies</h2><p>This site does not set its own cookies. If you follow an outbound or affiliate link to a vendor's site, that site may set its own cookies under its own privacy policy — that policy applies once you have left this site, not ours.</p><h2>Affiliate links</h2><p>Links that go through a <code>/go/</code> path on this site are affiliate links to third-party vendors. Clicking one may record, on our own server, which link was clicked and when, so we can tell which pages are useful — this record is not tied to your name, email, or any account, because we do not have accounts. See our <a href={`${base}disclosure`}>affiliate disclosure</a> for how these links work.</p><h2>If you email us</h2><p>If you contact us (see <a href={`${base}contact`}>/contact</a>), we keep that email only to answer you and to keep a record of correspondence like correction requests. We do not add you to a mailing list from a one-off email, and we do not share your message with anyone outside our own small team.</p><h2>Changes</h2><p>If this policy changes in a way that matters, we will update the date at the top of this page.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about this policy go to the same place as everything else — see <a href={`${base}contact`}>/contact</a>.</p></section></Base><style>.simple{max-width:750px;padding:5rem 0}.simple h1{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4.5rem)}.simple h2{font-size:1.5rem;margin-top:2.5rem}.simple p{line-height:1.7;font-size:1.05rem}.simple code{background:var(--surface);padding:.1rem .4rem;border-radius:.3rem}</style>
